      "explanation": "At a withheld qos-ok boundary Go sends context-triggered basic.cancel concurrently; Node queues automatic cancellation until the current RPC reply. The Go probe ends at the observed wire boundary, without asserting success or failure of concurrent Go RPC replies."
    },
