        "body": "after-cancel",
        "consumers": 1,
        "delivered": true
      },
      "explanation": "With the reconnect proxy blocked, Go cancellation returns on the closed channel and leaves consumer recovery intent, so the consumer is restored. Node removes cancelled consumer intent while retaining queue/exchange topology without broker acknowledgement. Cancellation after completed recovery matches Go."
    }
